  "limits": "A uniform, perfectly flexible and inextensible cable under gravity only: no wind, stiffness, stretch or point loads. The anchors must differ horizontally; a vertical hang is refused. Very large slack values make a deep U that the segment count may sample coarsely. Verified in Blender 5.2.1; written for the 4.2 API.",
